# The public API. Create a key under Developers > API keys (as an admin) and paste it below.
# The full reference, generated from the OpenAPI document, is at {{baseUrl}}/api/reference.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5081
@apiKey = lnt_paste-your-key-here
@collection = handbook

### OpenAPI document (no key needed)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/openapi/v1.json

### Without a key: 401 problem details
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/collections

### List collections
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/collections
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### Create a collection
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/collections
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "{{collection}}",
  "description": "The staff handbook"
}

### Create it again: 409 Conflict
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/collections
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "{{collection}}"
}

### Invalid name: 400 validation problem
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/collections
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Not Valid!"
}

### Get a collection
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/collections/{{collection}}
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### Unknown collection: 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/collections/does-not-exist
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### Ingest markdown
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/collections/{{collection}}/documents/markdown
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "source": "leave-policy.md",
  "markdown": "# Leave\n\nEveryone gets 25 days of paid leave a year.\n\n## Carrying over\n\nUp to 5 unused days carry over to the next year.",
  "tags": ["hr", "policies"],
  "chunking": { "maxCharacters": 1500 }
}

### Ingest a file (multipart)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/collections/{{collection}}/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="notes.md"
Content-Type: text/markdown

# Notes

Uploaded through the API.
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="tags"

notes, api
--boundary--

### Ingest a web page
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/collections/{{collection}}/documents/url
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://example.com/",
  "tags": ["web"]
}

### List documents (optionally ?tag=hr&source=leave)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/collections/{{collection}}/documents?tag=hr
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### List tags
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/collections/{{collection}}/tags
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### Get a document with its markdown (use an id from the list above)
@documentId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/documents/{{documentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### Download a document's original (PDFs and images only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/documents/{{documentId}}/original
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### Replace a document's tags
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/documents/{{documentId}}/tags
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tags": ["hr"]
}

### Delete a document
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/documents/{{documentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### Clear a collection (keeps the collection)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/collections/{{collection}}/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### Delete a collection
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/collections/{{collection}}
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### The default collection can't be deleted: 409
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/collections/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
